{"id":"en_trading-places-the-heiress-game","title":"Trading Places: The Heiress Game","titleEn":"Trading Places: The Heiress Game","description":"Sophia Dalton, the real heir of the Dalton family, comes back home, and Emma Dalton, who had been posing as a daughter of the family, is thrown out. Then a startling revelation changes everything: Emma is in fact the biological child of the country's wealthiest tycoon. Sophia starts an internship at the corporation belonging to Emma's family, and Emma chooses to act the underdog while plotting her revenge. What she discovers, though, is that Sophia has been using Emma's identity to seize control of the company.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/trading-places-the-heiress-game/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/trading-places-the-heiress-game/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Secret Identity","Scumbag-punishing","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlfea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_trading-places-the-heiress-game_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlfea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trading-places-the-heiress-game_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlfea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trading-places-the-heiress-game_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlfea/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trading-places-the-heiress-game_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free